###Block: Druid alternative class features
Huntsman	KEY:Druid ACF ~ Huntsman (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.DruidACF.DruidProficiencies.DruidWildShape	PRECLASS:1,Druid=1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Huntsman (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.228	DESC:Alternative class feature (druid, 1st level). A druid who gives up wild shape to become a swift and deadly hunter (swap): the monk's AC bonus when unarmored (with her Wisdom bonus) and fast movement, by druid level; the ranger's favored enemy, swift tracker (8th) and Track, at the ranger's levels (applied). Replaces armor and shield proficiency (she keeps the druid's weapons) and wild shape in all its versions.
