###Block: Ranger alternative class features
Predator	KEY:Ranger ACF ~ Predator (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.RangerACF.RangerCombatStyle.RangerImprovedCombatStyle.RangerCombatStyleMastery	PRECLASS:1,Ranger=2	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Predator (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.488	DESC:Alternative class feature (ranger, 2nd level). A ranger who forgoes weapon combat training to take animal form and move swiftly through the woodlands (swap): wild shape as a druid of his ranger level from 5th (Small or Medium animals only - ignore the larger, plant and elemental forms by hand) and fast movement as the barbarian (+10 feet, not in heavy armor) (applied). Replaces combat style, improved combat style and combat style mastery.
Predator	KEY:ACF ~ Predator (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	ABILITY:Druid Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Druid ~ Wild Shape|PREVARGTEQ:RangerLVL,5	BONUS:VAR|DruidWildShapeLVL|RangerLVL	ABILITY:Barbarian Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Barbarian ~ Fast Movement	SOURCEPAGE:p.488	DESC:A ranger who forgoes weapon combat training to take animal form and move swiftly through the woodlands (swap): wild shape as a druid of his ranger level from 5th (Small or Medium animals only - ignore the larger, plant and elemental forms by hand) and fast movement as the barbarian (+10 feet, not in heavy armor) (applied). Replaces combat style, improved combat style and combat style mastery.

###Block: Fighter alternative class features
Armored Savant	KEY:Fighter ACF ~ Armored Savant (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.FighterACF.FighterArmoredSavant	PRECLASS:1,Fighter=1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Armored Savant (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.276	DESC:Alternative class feature (fighter, 1st level). A mystic connection to your armor (supernatural): you ignore its weight for encumbrance, it slows you as one category lighter (medium armor does not slow you, heavy as medium), its maximum Dexterity bonus improves by +1 and its arcane spell failure chance is halved (by hand on the armor). Replaces the fighter bonus feat at 1st level (applied).
Armored Savant	KEY:ACF ~ Armored Savant (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Fighter Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|Pool_FighterFeat|-((FighterLVL>=1))	SOURCEPAGE:p.276	DESC:A mystic connection to your armor (supernatural): you ignore its weight for encumbrance, it slows you as one category lighter (medium armor does not slow you, heavy as medium), its maximum Dexterity bonus improves by +1 and its arcane spell failure chance is halved (by hand on the armor). Replaces the fighter bonus feat at 1st level (applied).
Bonded Armor	KEY:Fighter ACF ~ Bonded Armor (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.FighterACF.FighterBondedArmor	PRECLASS:1,Fighter=8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Bonded Armor (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.276	DESC:Alternative class feature (fighter, 8th level). After wearing the same suit of heavy armor for 30 days and a 24-hour ritual (100 gp), the armor becomes part of you: you don or remove it as a full-round action, and while worn, awake and free to move it grants a +%1 insight bonus to AC (+1 at 8th, +2 at 14th, +3 at 20th; by hand, as it depends on the bonded suit). Supernatural. Replaces the fighter bonus feat at 8th level (applied).
Bonded Armor	KEY:ACF ~ Bonded Armor (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Fighter Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|Pool_FighterFeat|-((FighterLVL>=8))	SOURCEPAGE:p.276	DESC:After wearing the same suit of heavy armor for 30 days and a 24-hour ritual (100 gp), the armor becomes part of you: you don or remove it as a full-round action, and while worn, awake and free to move it grants a +%1 insight bonus to AC (+1 at 8th, +2 at 14th, +3 at 20th; by hand, as it depends on the bonded suit). Supernatural. Replaces the fighter bonus feat at 8th level (applied).|1+(FighterLVL>=14)+(FighterLVL>=20)
