Warrior of Fire	KEY:Fighter ACF ~ Warrior of Fire (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.FighterACF.FighterWarriorOfFire	PRECLASS:1,Fighter=2	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Warrior of Fire (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.293	DESC:Alternative class feature (fighter, 2nd level). You are linked with the elemental power of fire: fire resistance %1 (5 at 2nd level, 10 at 12th, 20 at 20th); from 6th level burning hands 3/day as a spell-like ability (caster level your fighter level); extra fire damage on a successful critical hit with an unarmed strike or melee weapon (+1d6 at 6th, +2d6 at 12th, +3d6 at 20th); fire shield once per day at 12th level and three times per day at 20th (all applied as spell-like abilities). Replaces the fighter bonus feats at 2nd, 6th, 12th and 20th level (applied).
